      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "设 $A=\\{10,20,30,40,50,60\\}$。用式子给出集合 $A$ 到它",
        "自身的两种不同的映射。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "348",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "函数 $f$ 的表示式是 $y=\\frac{1-25x}{3}$。下列命题是真命题吗？",
        "$f(0)=\\frac{1}{3}$；$f(1)=-8$；$f(-0.1)=0.8$；$f(-4)=33\\frac{2}{3}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "349",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "指出下列各式给出的函数的定义域：",
        "а) $y=\\frac{7}{x^2-4}$；　　б) $y=\\frac{8}{x^2+4}$；",
        "в) $y=\\frac{1}{|x|-x}$；　　г) $y=\\frac{1}{|x|+x}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "第11小节"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "350",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "关系 $f$ 的图象是两条射线 $OA$ 和 $OB$ 的并集（图 $86$）。",
        "关系 $f$ 是不是函数？点 $C(2,2),\\ D(-3.5,3.5),$",
        "$E(-91\\frac{1}{3},91\\frac{1}{3}),\\ F(1002.7,1002.7)$ 是关系 $f$ 的图象上",
        "的点吗？"
      ]
    },
